                <head>Agreement between the United States and Guatemala renewing the agreement of
                    July 17, 1943, respecting the detail of a military officer to serve as Director
                    of the Polytechnic School of Guatemala</head>
                <p>[For text of agreement, effected by exchange of notes signed at Washington
                    January 5 and 17, 1944, effective July 17, 1944, see Department of State
                    Executive Agreement Series No. 397, or 58 Stat, (pt. 2) 1223. For text of the
                    original agreement, signed at Washington July 17, 1943, see Department of State
                    Executive Agreement Series No. 329, or 57 Stat. (pt. 2) 1011.]</p>
            </div>
